    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a dry spell though. it feels more like an autopsy. i'm just staring at a corpse of a person. every time i try to force something, i just realize how much of a lie my whole career has been. i'm just taking up space that could be used by someone who actually has something to offer. i'm just a vacancy.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
